# Mirrors `ignorePatterns` in .eslintrc.json, and it has to.
#
# ESLint deliberately skips these; Prettier has no equivalent list, so without
# this file `npm run format` reaches files nothing should be reformatting. Two of
# them bite:
#
#   src/lib/generated/content.ts  is written by `npm run content`, and CI asserts
#     the committed output matches a fresh regeneration (`git diff --exit-code`
#     over src/lib/generated/). Reformatting it produces churn the next
#     regeneration undoes, and fails that step.
#   src/styles/fonts.css  is lifted verbatim out of next/font's build output. It
#     is a generated artefact kept byte-for-byte on purpose, so that the rendered
#     type, the unicode-range splitting and the metric-adjusted fallbacks are
#     provably the same bytes the loader produced.
#
# Keep this in step with .eslintrc.json if that list ever changes.

node_modules/
.next/
out/
public/
src/lib/generated/
src/lib/imagery.ts
src/styles/fonts.css
